  m_text: "I\u2019m done taking the long way to the grocery\nEvery time I go through
    those alleys, someone wants to stop and talk.\n\nMaintenance still hasn\u2019t
    fixed the broken road, so I made my own way across.\nMuch quicker. Much quieter."
